sniffile (0.10-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First tagged release: v0.10.
  * Phone photos now respect their EXIF orientation, so portrait shots no
    longer appear sideways in the preview.
  * Windows: reveal selects the file in Explorer, path checks are
    case-insensitive, and the build script uses the matching g++.
  * Windows desktop window and NSIS installer included in the release.

 -- openastolfo-boop <openastolfo-boop@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000

sniffile (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Native desktop window is now the default on Linux and Windows.
  * Fixed WebKitGTK build failure on WebKitGTK 4.1-only distributions.
  * Fixed a Wayland + NVIDIA crash in the GTK web view.
  * Added Debian, RPM, Alpine, Arch and Windows packaging.
  * Added desktop entry, AppStream metadata, man page and icons.

 -- openastolfo-boop <openastolfo-boop@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 15 Nov 2026 11:00:00 +0000
